  "question": {
    "text": "An arc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;of a circle subtends a right angle at its centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>. The mid point of the arc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, are the roots of the equation"
  },
